      "hizbQuarter": 113,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2041,
      "text": "We have made the day and night as two signs. We darkened the night and made the day bright, so that you may seek your Lord’s bounty and know the number of years and calculation [of time]. And We have expounded everything in detail.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 283,
      "ruku": 241,
      "hizbQuarter": 113,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2042,
      "text": "We have bound every man’s deeds to his neck[11]. On the Day of Resurrection, We will bring forth for him a record which he will find spread open.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
