      "hizbQuarter": 113,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2046,
      "text": "How many generations We have destroyed since the time of Noah[14]! Your Lord is sufficient as All-Aware and All-Seeing of the sins of His slaves[15].",
